"Missing permissions: the account %(account)s cannot read %(count)s git "
"repositories owned by %(owner)s. Give it read access to their .git "
"directories."
msgstr ""
"Il manque des permissions : le compte %(account)s ne peut pas lire "
"%(count)s dépôts git appartenant à %(owner)s. Donnez-lui l'accès en lecture "
"à leurs dossiers .git."

#. module: erplibre_info
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/erplibre_info/runner.py:0
